# 原紙集め (design 11.2.3), for tools/ui_run.py. Its window (660,40 to 880,528, the work
# area from 670,69, a scroll bar down the right and along the foot, its sizing corner at
# 870,518) is the cabinet's, as the 原紙箱's: the templates of the applications of the
# program box laid out in rows from the left as far as the work area is wide. Made
# narrower, every template is on a row of its own and the widest is wider than the work
# area: the list is scrolled down and across by the bars. Made wider, more are on a row.
# MPEG Player deleted takes its template out of the list at once, registered again
# puts it back at the end. 空書庫 carried into the BTRON window makes a new object
# from it there, and the list stays as it was.
waitwin 原紙箱
open 01a0d8c4-5b92-7c53-8d64-9fab0c1d5b92
waitwin 原紙集め
expect basecol: up
expect basecol: 16 templates in 13 rows
wait 1000
shot bc_open
# narrower and lower by the sizing corner: one to a row, the bars to scroll by
logmark
drag 870 518 760 300
expectsince basecol: 16 templates in 16 rows
wait 1000
win 原紙集め
want ok 660 40 770 310
shot bc_small
# down by the wheel, and across by the bar along the foot (its knob from the left end)
wheel -3
wait 800
shot bc_down
drag 676 300 750 300
wait 800
shot bc_across
# wider: three and four to a row
logmark
drag 760 300 1060 400
expectsince basecol: 16 templates in
wait 1000
win 原紙集め
want ok 660 40 1070 410
shot bc_wide
# MPEG Player deleted: out of the list at once; registered again: back, at the end
logmark
progrm 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok 0
expectsince basecol: 15 templates
proginst 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok 0
expectsince basecol: 16 templates
wait 800
shot bc_reinst
# 再表示 from the menu (the second button over the list: 閉じる under the pointer, 再表示
# under the line, at 1015,421)
logmark
click 1000 380 1
expectsince basecol: menu
wait 600
shot bc_menu
move 1015 421
wait 150
click 1015 421
expectsince basecol: command reread
expectsince basecol: 16 templates
# closed (Ctrl+E): nothing of it is kept, and nothing is asked of the program object it
# stands for but reading it (no write of its attributes refused)
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince basecol: closed
wait 500
absent !OACV!
